From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Subject: [PATCH] Require completed modem stop before reporting shutdown

A queued stop request is not completion. Retry the kernel's EINPROGRESS
status within the existing stop deadline, then require the raw GATED state.
Return failure for a latched stop error, unknown state or deadline, close
owned descriptors once, and use the same shutdown path on lifetime expiry.
Module unload and manual unbind remain unsupported.

Link: https://github.com/MT6895-Mainline/mtk-ccci-userspace/tree/f6147b10cf7ef95932674506fbdfb7f3d67a1067
---
